  "id": 557,
  "title": "智慧园区综合安防集成系统解决方案",
  "date": "2024-02-28",
  "summary": "",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-557.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-2-28/20242281538449541.png",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">综合安全系统主要用于商业综合体、办公楼、企业园区、住宅小区等场景。结合用户的综合安全特点，需求分析如下:</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">&#216;子系统的融合</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">信息孤岛问题一直是困扰客户的最大问题。如果每个接入子系统都能被视为平台的管理模块，实现平台的统一管理，协调每个接入子系统的运行，整个系统的有机结合，就能满足客户的真实期望。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">&#216;智能化运行管理</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">庞大的系统建设带来了运维人员成本的增加；同时也会影响系统的使用，直接导致使用效率低下；另一方面，随着行业技术的进一步发展，平台的智能运营管理应用越来越被客户认可。因此，管理平台对智能运营管理的支持已经成为行业的趋势。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">&#216;业务能力平稳扩展</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">过去需要扩展安全服务，通常通过在平台上增加功能模块或依靠平台访问其他业务系统。由于整体复用性差，开发维护成本相当高，也影响了产品质量，越来越无法适应开发需求。以组件的形式开发业务模块，实现自由组合，将很好地解决系统无法顺利扩展的问题。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">&#216;智能应用</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">多年来，传统的图像识别和图像处理算法仍然存在识别准确率低、环境适应性差、识别类型少等问题，严重限制了智能应用的普及。如何从复杂的数据中成功提取需要管理者关注或处理的信息，让管理者轻松管理整个安全系统，将成为系统智能化的直接表现。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">&#216;开放式对接模式</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">在项目运营中，经常会遇到不同品牌之间的合作，建立智能弱电系统，或者建立新的或者利用旧的。第三方业务系统的数据交互、资源共享等问题成为系统整合的瓶颈，平台整合和整合成为难题，客户希望获得非常流畅的资源交互环境。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">一.1 建设目标</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">综合安全系统建设的目的是利用一套软件管理平台集中控制和管理每个安全项目系统，统一数据库存储和分发所有项目系统前端的采集数据，提供统一的操作界面，实现资源共享、业务整合和各个系统的联动。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">按照建设部《智能建筑设计标准》建设系统（GB/T 50314-2015)等相关文件规定和国家和地方政府加强综合安全系统信息化建设的指示精神，基于“高起点、高效率”的原则，建立了“人防部署到位、物防设施完善、技术手段先进、应急处置高效”的集管理、预防和控制于一体的安全保障体系，以提前预防、事中处理、事后分析为基本要求，切实加强安全保障和应急响应能力。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">本方案采用***综合安全管理平台（iSecure Center）以综合视频监控、车辆控制、一卡通等系统为核心，通过上层综合安全管理平台的统一协调，实现各应用子系统之间的资源共享和信息交流，可以根据需要整合物业管理、社区管理等安全管理系统，实现管理便利性和数据直观性，实现各应用子系统之间的智能联动。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">&#216;统一的子系统集成</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">iSecure Center平台统一管理和控制每个子系统，以相同的环境和相同的软件界面集中管理分散独立的子系统。提供人员、组织、资源等基础数据的统一管理，确保同一物理资源在一个产品或多个产品中的独特性，可以连接并实现一个输入多个地方的使用，为产品相互整合提供机制保障。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">&#216;统一监控平台运行</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">iSecure Center平台运行管理中心为系统交付和维护人员提供一站式安装、运行和维护服务。通过运行管理中心，可以实时了解软件的运行状态，方便地根据运行管理中心提供的信息定位和解决问题，保证系统的正常运行。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">&#216;业务弹性扩展</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">iSecure 基于组件化设计，Center平台以新组件的形式满足业务的横向扩展。只需在一套iSecure 在Center软件下，通过增加相应的业务组件，可以满足复杂项目的需求，避免过去一个项目部署多个平台的复杂情况，彻底解决一线人员的痛点。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">&#216;智能应用</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">iSecure Center平台实现了车牌识别、人脸识别等基于深度学习算法的智能应用领域的广泛拓展和延伸，实现了各种功能和应用的整合和集成，实现了系统之间的智能联动和智能管理。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">&#216;开放应用接口</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">iSecure 基于软件集成框架和统一规范，Center平台通过http接口提供基本服务，实现应用接口的开放，支持第三方应用快速集成，接口遵循RESTful规范；通过动态新设备接入驱动，平台可以实现第三方设备的接入。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">一.2 建设内容</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">构建一套综合安全管理平台（iSecure Center）综合安全系统是核心，包括以下子系统：</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">1)周界防范子系统(实现入侵报警、紧急报警、视频周界)；</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">二是视频监控子系统(实现基本视频、全景监控)；</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">3)车辆控制子系统(出入口管理、寻车诱导、园区卡口、行车监控)；</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">4)一卡通子系统(门禁、可视对讲、电梯层控、巡逻、人员通道、访客、考勤、食堂消费)，推荐以人脸为认证介质的智能一脸通子系统；</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">5)综合控制子系统(实现报警事件联动、图片监控、智能监控)；</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">运行维护管理(实现设备和平台的运行维护)；</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">总体设计第一章</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">一.1 设计思路</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">在系统设计过程中，充分考虑了各子系统的信息共享要求，结构化、标准化地设计了各子系统，通过系统之间的各种联动方式将其整合成一个有机的整体，使其成为一个整体、全方位的综合安全系统，从而达到人防、物防、技防的目的。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">第一，整体设计一步到位</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">在整体系统设计中，综合安全管理平台的集成性、开放性和可扩展性得到充分利用，各子系统的管理和信息可以最大限度地共享，同时考虑未来系统的扩展和容量增加。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">二是子系统独立分控，整体集成</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">每个子系统不仅可以独立工作，还可以通过综合安全管理平台与其他子系统有机协同工作和联动预防，形成一个完整的安全技术预防系统。在统一的人机界面上完成系统操作和处理，实现分散监控、控制和集中管理、统一调度的目的。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">三是安全措施全面全面，业务联动</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">系统设计采取各种安全防范措施，以达到周密到位的安全防范目的。综合安全系统主要由周界防范、视频监控、停车场、智能一脸通等子系统组成。基于综合安全管理平台，系统将实现各种业务之间的联动管理。比如报警子系统检测到报警情况，门禁子系统识别到强制开门，停车场子系统发现黑名单车辆后，可以通过综合安全管理平台设置触发视频监控子系统进行抓图、弹窗显示、视频存储。同时，联动平台控制器开始与相应的语音通道进行对讲和发送短信。</span><br /></p>",
